---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "DQ Chocolate Shake",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/chocolate-shake.webp",
      "description": "Thick DQ soft serve hand-blended with chocolate syrup into a rich, creamy shake. Available in small, medium, and large. All DQ shakes also available as malts.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "3.49",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/chocolate-shake"
      },
      "nutrition": {
        "@type": "NutritionInformation",
        "calories": "~710 cal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much is a DQ chocolate shake?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Small $3.49, Medium $4.29, Large $4.99. 2026 national averages."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How many calories are in a DQ chocolate shake?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Small approximately 710 cal, Medium approximately 950 cal, Large approximately 1,270 cal. Peanut Butter is the highest-calorie flavor."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the difference between a DQ shake and malt?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A malt adds malted milk powder, creating a slightly tangy, nutty flavor depth. Price is typically the same as the shake."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Chocolate Shake — Price, Calories & Flavors 2026" description="DQ Chocolate Shake price: from $3.49. Thick hand-blended chocolate shake in small, medium, and large. All 6 shake flavors, malt option, and full calorie guide.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/drinks">Drinks</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Chocolate Shake</span></li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/chocolate-shake.webp" alt="DQ Chocolate Shake — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Thick Hand-Blended</span><span class="badge">6 Flavors Available</span><span class="badge blue">All Sizes</span></div>
      <h1>DQ Chocolate Shake</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">From $3.49</div>
      <p>Rich, creamy, and decadently thick. The DQ Chocolate Shake blends world-famous vanilla soft serve with deep chocolate syrup and fresh milk, crowned with light whipped topping. Available in three generous sizes starting from $3.49 for a Small (~710 cal), every flavor can also be ordered as an old-fashioned malt.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>$3.49 (Small)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories (Small)</td><td>~710 cal</td></tr><tr><td>Flavors</td><td>Chocolate · Vanilla · Strawberry · PB · Hot Fudge · Caramel</td></tr><tr><td>Malt Available</td><td>Yes — same price, malted milk powder added</td></tr><tr><td>Sizes</td><td>Small · Medium · Large</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories by Size — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Small Chocolate Shake</strong></td><td>$3.49</td><td class="price-cell">~710 cal</td><td>~20g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Medium Chocolate Shake</strong></td><td>$4.29</td><td class="price-cell">~950 cal</td><td>~28g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Large Chocolate Shake</strong></td><td>$4.99</td><td class="price-cell">~1,270 cal</td><td>~37g</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Your local DQ may vary slightly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Shake vs. Fast Food Shake — What Makes DQ Different</h2>
  <p>The secret behind Dairy Queen's legendary shake consistency is its soft-serve foundation. Instead of using pre-mixed liquid shake bases like typical drive-thrus, DQ crews hand-blend every cup to order using the exact same dense soft serve that goes into our upside-down Blizzards. This yields an exceptionally thick, velvety beverage that holds its temperature and rich chocolate flavor down to the final sip. Discover our full beverage spread on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> or browse the <a href="/categories/drinks">Drinks category</a>.</p>
  <h2>All DQ Shake Flavors</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Flavor</th><th>Small Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Chocolate</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~710</td><td>Classic, most popular</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Vanilla</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~590</td><td>Clean, creamy, pairs with any meal</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Strawberry</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~650</td><td>Fruity and bright</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Peanut Butter</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~790</td><td>Rich and indulgent, highest calorie</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Hot Fudge</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~740</td><td>Deeper chocolate with fudge swirl</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Caramel</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~700</td><td>Sweet caramel throughout</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Shake vs. Malt — Which to Order</h2>
  <p>Looking for nostalgic 1950s soda shop flavor? Ask for your shake to be made as a malt. By blending in a scoop of classic malted barley powder, the drink gains a toasted, nutty depth that cuts through the intense sweetness. It costs virtually the same as a standard shake, and Chocolate Malt remains the quintessential starting point for anyone new to malted milkshakes.</p>
  <h2>Related Drinks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté® Frozen Coffee — from $4.29</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/drinks">Full DQ Drinks Menu</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Blizzard (if you want more mix-ins)</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is a DQ chocolate shake?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">National average prices for 2026 are $3.49 for a Small, $4.29 for a Medium, and $4.99 for a Large.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How many calories are in a DQ chocolate shake?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A Small delivers roughly 710 calories, a Medium contains about 950 calories, and a Large reaches 1,270 calories. Calorie totals vary depending on flavor choice.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the difference between a DQ shake and malt?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A malt includes real malted milk powder, giving the shake an earthy, nutty, vintage soda fountain aroma. It is typically prepared at the same price as a regular shake.</div></div>
      </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For the complete 2026 DQ food and treats menu, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
      See all Blizzard flavors on the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

