  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Chocolate Shake — Complete Flavor &amp; Nutrition Guide</h2>
    <p>All DQ shakes use the same thick soft-serve base. Here is the full comparison across all flavors at the Small size to help you choose:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Shake Flavor</th><th>Small Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Flavor Notes</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Vanilla</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~590</td><td>Lightest option, neutral and creamy</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Caramel</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~700</td><td>Sweet caramel throughout</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Chocolate</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~710</td><td>Classic — most popular</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Strawberry</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~650</td><td>Fruity and bright</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Hot Fudge</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~740</td><td>Deeper chocolate with fudge swirl</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Peanut Butter</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~790</td><td>Most indulgent, highest calorie</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <h2>Related DQ Drinks</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté® Frozen Blended Coffee — from $4.29</a></li>
